 alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-a4b81e3c2b71cf1fEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-216176e3da7a695dEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_GEN_World_AdventuresofBalduran001</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_GEN_World_AdventuresofBalduran001\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_GEN_World_AdventuresofBalduran001\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">9cb501b9-2644-48cf-abad-382ec79c5837</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:9cb501b9-2644-48cf-abad-382ec79c5837\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:9cb501b9-2644-48cf-abad-382ec79c5837\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nansi_Gretta\" title=\"Nansi Gretta\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/25px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/38px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/50px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nansi Gretta\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/25px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nansi_Gretta\" title=\"Nansi Gretta\">Nansi Gretta</a></li>\n<li>In <a href=\"/wiki/The_Hollow\" title=\"The Hollow\">The Hollow</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;202&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;551</span></li>\n<li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Mouth_Basement\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Baldur's Mouth Basement\">Baldur's Mouth Basement</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1019&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;1039</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[This book is packed full of tales of adventure. The monsters are ferocious, the men are muscled, the women are buxom and the clothing is easily torn. Something is 'cleft in twain' on every other page, although you do find a passage that's a little less bloody.]\n</p><p><br>\nThe woman's eyes were dusky, filled with mystery and promise. Balduran was intrigued. \n</p><p>'Anything?' he asked. \n</p><p>'Anything,' she said. 'Just name it, and it can be yours.'\n</p><p>'And what do you want in return?'\n</p><p>'Oh, just a small thing,' she smiled. \n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Balduran\" title=\"Balduran\">Balduran</a> laughed. NOTHING about him was small. \n</p><p>'I want your soul, Balduran,' she sighed. 'Give me your spirit, and whatever you desire shall be yours.'\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Balduran considered this for a moment. 'Very well. I want a turnip.'\n</p><p>She hesitated. 'Your soul in exchange for a turnip?'\n</p><p>'A nice turnip,' nodded Balduran. \n</p><p>'Very well,' dark smoke swirled around the woman, whose skin was turning red, 'then you shall-\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>[The next couple of pages have been torn out. When the story resumes, the woman - now fully revealed as a devil - is kneeling at Balduran's feet.] \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>'Curse you, Balduran! I am bound to you - yours to call upon when you need me - and your soul is your own once more.'\n</p><p>'Let that be a lesson to you,' laughed Balduran. 'Never underestimate the power of a turnip.'\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715042404\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.052 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1610/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32652/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11801/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 928266/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.386      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   42.386      1 -total\n 51.00%   21.619      7 Template:Icon_text\n 44.98%   19.066     17 Template:Trim\n 23.41%    9.921      2 Template:Uid\n 15.36%    6.509      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.45%    5.703      2 Template:Template_style\n 12.70%    5.381      2 Template:Icon_link\n 10.25%    4.345      7 Template:Ifempty\n  9.92%    4.203      1 Template:Books\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12515-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715042404 and revision id 397039. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}